== Trivia ==
* Lachryphagy is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=893096768 this Steam Workshop item] by KittyK47, originally known as Hungry Tears.
* [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lachryphagy Lachryphagy] refers to the insect practice of drinking tears or eye secretions from other creatures.
* Isaac's appearance (his eyes being replaced by gaping mouths) is similar to [[sandman:The Corinthian|the Corinthian]] from Neil Gaiman's "The Sandman".

